{
  "rationale": "We separate sensing (arena state) and motion (action execution) in the plant. The plant G1 models the robot's perception and action execution, with helper states for action commits and recovery. The specification E1 binds sensor outcomes to exactly one allowed action per state, enforcing safety (no forward into obstacles, deterministic recovery, no oscillation, no random_walk in recovery).",
  "strategy": [
    "Plant G1 encodes all possible sensor situations and action commits, ensuring totality for uncontrollables and one controllable per non-terminal state.",
    "Spec E1 enforces safe action selection, deterministic recovery, and disables unsafe or oscillatory behaviors."
  ],
